invariant: INV-17
file: rsa_sign64.c
catches: rsa_sign_equiv_test
reason: the recombination returns without the wipe below its body, so qinv's
  words and the factor h stay in the stack.
  bin/rsa_sign_equiv_test requires no two words of a value the call held
  in the stack below it, and requires the stack equal under two secrets
  (docs/decisions.md 181).

--- old
    garner(s, m1, m2, qinv, half_len, mod_p, mod_q);
    rsa_sign64_wipe_below();
--- new
    garner(s, m1, m2, qinv, half_len, mod_p, mod_q);
